MN2BVJQ","text":"たしかカレーの補充もします。食パンはキザなだけで特徴はあまりないです。","ts":"1624892699.339800","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1624892721.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cAv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e20da2c-6cf2-4e54-87d8-ab5e1ee02415","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"実際激辛カレーで毒霧したら目をやられるかもしれん","ts":"1624892697.339700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1+Esw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c403e67e-09ff-4998-b172-01bb3ba842e4","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"カレーは劇薬だった…？プロレスラーの毒霧みたいなことしてるな","ts":"1624892659.338800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OV8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd3a241d-fe0c-4f48-8613-2b49b9cc98b7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうだったんだw","ts":"1624892556.338100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C8b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bea6ffd-82ec-46ff-bb5c-303651485100","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"カレーパンマンは攻撃でカレーを吐きます。ちなみに吐きすぎると弱ります。","ts":"1624892536.337900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nandato","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YFI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d091e06-a5ac-4062-a05f-8de0e6a34da3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"カレーパンマン、頭ちぎったら中身全部出て致命傷になりそう","ts":"1624892492.337200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"89Lic"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c13f2987-3500-4e5a-ae13-fed53b2974f5","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"子供の頃アンパンマン見てたわけじゃないから詳しくないけど、食パンもカレーパンも食わせてる記憶がない…","ts":"1624892468.336700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"37SL1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7087f9a8-289a-41fb-a69e-3480ca93e93f","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"観測した限りだといなさそう…(食べさせるのがアンパンマンのアイデンティティーなので)","ts":"1624892465.336600","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1624892488.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BJpdu"}]}]
